	"VersionName": "1.0",
	"FriendlyName": "VR Eye-Tracking Logger",
	"Description": "Logs eye-tracking and head-tracking data from VR headsets to TSV files, computes fixations with a VR-centred I-DT algorithm (Llanes-Jurado et al. 2020), and visualizes gaze and fixation replays in the editor. Includes a spectator camera pawn for observing VR sessions.",
	"Category": "Virtual Reality",
	"CreatedBy": "lucsdjango",
